    },
    {
     "code": "P98",
     "type": "DesignNote",
     "value": "The EWSR1/PATZ1 fusion gene also arises in a complex rearrangement where inversion of 22q12 is followed by a translocation t(1;22)(p34;q12) that disrupts the UQCRH gene. PCR analysis of tumor cDNA and genomic DNA detected UQCRH/EWSR1, PATZ1/UQCRH and EWSR1/PATZ1 fusion transcripts. The UQCRH containing fusion genes produced out-of-frame transcripts containing premature stop codons. (OMIM)"
    },
